{"availability":"available","full":"chok/fougere","name":"fougere","description":"Write the domain: one TypeScript entity class becomes your validation, SQL tables, GraphQL/REST API and forms — no codegen. Moving it to its own process is one line of config.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":5,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-30T21:18:51Z","updated":"2026-10-02T16:03:48Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://fougere.dev","topics":["api","crud","framework","fullstack","graphql","json-rpc","json-schema","kysely","microservices","modular-monolith","nodejs","nuxt","orm","rest","rpc","schema","sqlite","type-safe","typescript","validation"],"demo":null,"color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T09:36:58.563Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-03T09:36:58.563Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-03T09:36:58.563Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T09:36:58.563Z","discoveredVia":[],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T09:36:58.563Z","stars":5,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Node.js","Vue"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Write the domain. Everything else is a projection of it — including the wire.","One class declares the business object. From it come the TypeScript type, the validator, the SQL table, the form contract and the API surface — and because the declaration is JSON on the wire, the domain can move to its own process, or to another language, while the code calling it does not change.","readOnly is not a note about intent: it removes the field from what a client may ever send, so publishing cannot be a field write — it has to be an operation."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/chok/fougere/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"5541ed4dfe6b7172601d4821aa48807dfedfbda07151dc7ef5f11ef0b25477a2","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T09:36:58.563Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T09:36:58.563Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Write the domain. Everything else is a projection of it — including the wire.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/chok/fougere/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"Known limits, because you would find them anyway: the boot never writes a schema — fougere migrate applies what fougere freeze recorded — tables, columns, renames, drops — and a type change needs a migration you write; a computed field costs one read per row unless you name a view.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/chok/fougere/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"5541ed4dfe6b7172601d4821aa48807dfedfbda07151dc7ef5f11ef0b25477a2","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/chok/fougere/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-03T09:36:58.563Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-02T16:03:48Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/chok/fougere/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-03T09:36:58.563Z","hash":"5541ed4dfe6b7172601d4821aa48807dfedfbda07151dc7ef5f11ef0b25477a2","originalBytes":7863,"storedBytes":7863,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["one","fougere","user","class","published","type","validator","what","blog","form","table","title","code","default","demos","domain","draft","export","extends","field","graphql","nothing","post","publish","readonly","same","schema","write","another","app","author","body","boot","contract","declaration","does","entities","entity","key","line","npm","only","own","publishedat","rest","split","status","surface","through","types","typescript","about","adopting","alpha","already","api","app.","axes","back","because","browser","calling","cannot","changes","come","const","costs","created","database","date","else","fields","find","frond","fronds","generated","handlers","in-process","list","loopback","message","never","new","operations","optional","pages","per","pnpm","post.pick","postcard","postdraft","posts","project","promise","rather","ref","refused","row","rules","running","rust-frond","share","side","site","sql","standard","stays","summary","text","them","